splatoon has been one of nintendo's most  surprising new franchises in recent  years a wild combination of shooter and  zone control in a stylish multiplayer  package now with switch well established  and extremely successful splatoon 3  looks to bring back the inky magic  here's everything we know about splatoon  3 so far including the release date  multiplayer details and what to expect  from the single player campaign mode  platoon 3 features a few changes for the  series the most obvious of which is the  setting splatoon 3 takes place in an  arid desert wasteland known as the  splatlands at the heart of the desert is  a new hub city called splattsville where  players will gather between matches the  story mode appears to be mystery themed  this time around the series itself  focuses on a battle between the inklings  and the octarians after global warming  supposedly caused humans to go extinct  after the inklings won the great turf  war against the octarians which occurred  100 years or so before the first game  the inklings created the sport you play  in the splatoon games in order to  commemorate the inkling victory in the  first game you stopped the theft of the  zapfish by the octarians which helped  power the other major city in the series  inkopolis the second game featured the  player character rescuing splatfest  champion cali from being brainwashed by  the octarians splatoon 3 is set a year  and a half after that game as you once  again face off against the octarians who  now appear to have mutated you'll do  battle with the octarian army whose  members are covered in hair for some  reason  return of the mammalians sees your  inkling team up with agent 3 and your  sidekick small fry where you'll learn  about the fuzzy ooze and hopefully  finally get some answers about just what  the heck happened to turn squids into  kids and where all the humans went the  game will also take you to new locations  like alternia a large snowy land as well  as a dark mirrored city nintendo  promises the story will serve as the  epic finale to the series that splatoon  has been building to over the last few  games  the trailer for the game confirmed the  series signature 4v4 turf war mode will  return in splatoon 3. but this time  there will be new stages set in the  wilds around splatsville nintendo also  teased there will be new moves and  weapons as well such as a new bow and a  crab shaped auto bomb it also appears  that players will now launch themselves  onto the map from the air rather than  spawning in at designated locations this  could have big ramifications for the  late stages of matches if it lets  players land in contested areas in order  to spray down their ink before the timer  runs out quickly like the previous games  splatoon 3 will feature splat fests  large scale social events that the  community settles by choosing team  colors this time though the splat fest  consists of not two but three choices  players will fight in a 4v4 turf war  style match for the first round and then  convert to a tri-color second round whoa  three teams fight at the same time the  first place team will start in the  center while the other two teams will  start on opposing sides giving the  leader more of a challenge to defend  their turf nintendo has also confirmed  the return of salmon run this time with  a video showing its next wave this  version will once again feature  cooperative play as you work with  teammates to take out the enemies in  wave based rounds you'll have to take on  new large-scale bosses like slam and lid  a ufo that creates protective barriers  and big shot a muscly salmonid that  fires cannonballs a massive king salmon  called kahunza shows up as the final  challenge before you complete a stage  and you'll have to take it down with a  special egg cannon nintendo has also  said a big run mode will have samonitz  invade the city itself as a special  event that occurs every few months  finally splatoon 3 will add a new card  based game called table turf battle the  1v1 competitive mode has you place cards  with geometric shapes similar to touch  aminos on a board your goal is to claim  territory by placing blocks on your own  color on the board similar to the main  splatoon objective each player will get  a starter deck and there will be 150  cards to collect in all speaking of  gameplay though character customization  is also an important part of splatoon's  combat you can unlock new fashion  options including headgear clothing and  shoes from various vendors that  equipment comes with passive boosts to  certain abilities and you can swap out  abilities using a particular npc if you  just want a certain look aside from your  personal style you can also customize  your locker with accessories and your  favorite fashions which will serve as  the way you view recent opponents and  friends mailboxes littered throughout  the city will let you submit drawings  and you can snap selfies of your squid  kid with a photo mode  [Music]  all that being said multiplayer is the  foundation of the splatoon series and is  once again the central focus in splatoon  3. as we mentioned earlier the series  4v4 turf 4 mode is returning this time  with entirely new stages moves and  weapons including a brand new bow as we  mentioned before that can fire ink shot  arrows called the stinger and a melee  weapon with a charged shot called the  splatana it also appears some old  specials are returning in splatoon 3  after being cut from the series second  installment in the reveal trailer one  character can be seen firing a modified  inkzooka a special move from splatoon 1.  nintendo has also confirmed new specials  like the tactic cooler that dispenses  buff providing beverages the wave  breaker that pulses and marks opponents  and the reef slider that charges  straight into enemies charge into  opponents who need a good splat you'll  also have a few new moves in your  arsenal like the squid surge to burst up  walls and the squid roll to pop out of  the ink the multiplayer will launch with  12 maps and more are said to be coming  in three post launch updates you can  familiarize yourself by testing weapons  in test range explore maps in recon mode  and review highlights of matches  nintendo announced a large-scale dlc  plan that will see splatoon 3 be  supported for up to two years after  launch first and foremost nintendo will  create a new clothing catalog every  three months for two years after the  game releases new weapons will also  release with these categories too  because if you're gonna buy new clothing  you might as well get new ways to be  your enemies as well on top of the  standard ranked mode post launch updates  will add a high ranking x battle mode  along with league battles all of these  updates will be free however nintendo  also confirmed a paid dlc similar in  size to splatoon 2's octo expansion dlc  that will come at some point after the  game's release  as a premier nintendo property you'll  need a switch to play splatoon 3.  additionally you'll need to have a  nintendo switch online subscription to  play splatoon 3 online individual  memberships cost four dollars for one  month eight dollars for three months and  20 for one year while an annual family  plan runs for 35 dollars and covers up  to eight nintendo accounts across  multiple systems nintendo also has  recently added a switch online expansion  pass tier including bonuses like the  genesis and n64 classic catalogs along  with an included expansion for animal  crossing new horizons nintendo has not  outlined whether we'll be regularly  adding game dlc as a switch online  expands past perk but if so we may see  some bonuses included for splatoon 3. to  lend credence to this possibility  nintendo has already added splatoon 2's  story dlc as a bonus to the expansion  pass tier  [Music]  splatoon 3 releases on september 9th and  is up for pre-order at best buy amazon  gamestop target walmart and the nintendo  eshop all for 60 dollars if you  pre-order at walmart you get an adorable  squid plush for free and you can choose  between bright blue neon green neon pink  and neon purple for your new plush  friend best buy gives you a free key  chain and gamestop gets you a sticker  sheet in addition to all this a special  splatoon 3 switch oled was recently  released that special switch includes a  special ink splatter paint job on the  dock and joy-con controllers if all of  that isn't enough splatoon for you  nintendo also announced splatoon 3  amiibos including a yellow inkling a  blue octarian and small fry all of which  will arrive this holiday though no  specific release date has been announced  scanning these amiibos will net you  their gear combinations that they wear  in the game as well as other exclusive  gear and you'll be able to get them  individually or in a 3-pack and that's  everything you need to know before the  release of splatoon 3. now  get inking  [Music]
 

